+/**
+ * @copybrief RETRO_ENVIRONMENT_SET_CORE_OPTIONS_V2
+ *
+ * @deprecated This environment call has been superseded
+ * by RETRO_ENVIRONMENT_SET_CORE_OPTIONS_V2,
